<urn:plantdocs:alfalaval-m3:source:section_3> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Product introduction under the subtitle 'Gasketed plate-and-frame heat exchanger for a wide range of applications': the M3 belongs to the Alfa Laval Industrial line, is available with a large selection of plate and gasket types, and besides the normal single plate configuration also with double wall plates, which are used to avoid intermixing of fluids."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Gasketed plate-and-frame heat exchanger for a wide range of applications" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "alfalaval-m3.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find what kind of equipment the M3 is, which product line it belongs to and why double wall plates are offered."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 1 .

<urn:plantdocs:alfalaval-m3:source:table_azure_3> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Pipe connections table: the connection types with their thread standard designation - threaded port ISO 228 - G 1 1/4, internal parallel threaded ISO 228 - G 1, external parallel threaded ISO 228 - G 1 1/4 B, external tapered threaded ISO 7 - R 1 1/4 or 1 1/4 - 11.5 NPT."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Pipe connections" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "alfalaval-m3.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find which threaded pipe connection types the M3 has and their thread standard and size."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 2 .

<urn:plantdocs:alfalaval-m3:source:section_6> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Short introduction and a bulleted list of nine available features: glued gasket, clip-on gasket, leak chamber, fixed bolt head, key hole bolt opening, lifting lug, lining, lock washer and tightening bolt cover."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Features" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "alfalaval-m3.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find which optional design features are available for the M3."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 1 .

<urn:plantdocs:alfalaval-m3:source:table_azure_2> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Operational data table: maximum design pressure (barg/psig) and maximum design temperature (°C/°F) for frame FG under two pressure vessel codes - ASME 10.3 barg / 150 psig and 177 °C / 350 °F, PED 16.0 barg / 232 psig and 180 °C / 356 °F."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Operational data" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "alfalaval-m3.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the maximum design pressure and temperature of the M3 for the FG frame under the ASME or PED pressure vessel code."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 2 .

<urn:plantdocs:alfalaval-m3:source:table_azure_0> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Two tables under 'Technical data' merged into one source: the Plates table (plate names M3, M3-D, M3-G, M3-X with their type - single plate, double wall plate, Gemini (hygienic) double wall, single plate diagonal flow - and a free channel of 2.4 mm (0.095 in) for all) and the Materials table (heat transfer plates 316/316L, C-276, Ti, TiPd; field gaskets NBR, EPDM, FKM; flange connections carbon steel; pipe connections stainless steel, titanium; frame and pressure plate carbon steel, epoxy painted)."@en ;
    dcterms:type "table" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Plates" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "alfalaval-m3.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the available plate variants of the M3 with their plate type and free channel, and the materials of the plates, gaskets, connections and frame."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 2 .

<urn:plantdocs:alfalaval-m3:source:section_4> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Bulleted list of application areas, from Biotech and Pharmaceutical, Chemicals and Energy and Utilities to HVAC and Refrigeration, Marine and Transportation, Pulp and Paper and Water and Waste treatment."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Applications" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "alfalaval-m3.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Use it to find the industries and application areas the M3 is intended for."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 1 .

<urn:plantdocs:alfalaval-m3:source:section_7> a plm:PCA_100029513 ;
    dcterms:description "Introductory paragraph of the Alfa Laval 360° Service Portfolio: the services are meant to keep the equipment at top performance throughout its life cycle."@en ;
    dcterms:type "text_section" ;
    plm:PCA_100029521 "Extending performance with Alfa Laval 360° Service Portfolio" ;
    plm:PCA_100029534 "alfalaval-m3.pdf" ;
    skos:scopeNote "Answers nothing on its own; see alfalaval-m3/fig-1.2 for the list of services."@en ;
    schema:pageStart 1 .

